      "content": "but that \"small step\" thing doesn't make sense. if you look at it logically, if the outcome is always going to be the same no matter what i do, then the effort itself is just a waste of energy. it's like calculating the probability of something that's already a guaranteed zero. why bother with the struggle if the result is a net loss?",
